{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BaronofFircrest","id":"456542272373391362","is_bot":0,"username":"baronoffircrest"},"author_id":"456542272373391362","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"Toruv, having changed out of his armor into a smart smoking jacket, looks up from his papers and taps out his pipe. He doffs his pince-nez glasses and looks up inquiringly.","created_at":"2020-07-22T01:30:22.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735307724547555429","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"He writes a note detailing what he has learned and describes of a process that might accomplish a dream the Knights never thought would come to fruition\n\n\n*\"The Hunger we know as the assailant that the gods defended against, the Knights du Roi Soleil know to be called Croatoan. It is a powerful creature of the abyss kept alive by a regenerating process that returns every few years, consuming life and corrupting the divine.\"\n\n\"Our knowledge of this creature has been stated that killing it in our world does nothing to keep it contained or destroyed due to its unending lust for divine energy that is present in all life.\"\n\n\"The ritual here states that with enough divine energy, there is a way to power a spell for 24 hours that would trap its spirit through energy it has consumed and allow it to be killed without regenerating. Thus releasing all it has consumed.\"\n\n\"If what this note says is true, it could be possible to harness what is left to bring back the gods we have lost...\" \n\n\"It shows a circle of 12 items in an arcane sort of funnel that can act as a way to contain the Hunger and redirect the flow of its discharged souls...\"\n\n\"The items must have immense amounts of divine energy though, I am not quite certain of where we will find such pieces. I will study further and reveal when I find answers\" \n\n - - Florian Chapelle <:KnightsduRoiSoleilFlag:715341871596961864>","created_at":"2020-07-22T01:35:22.261000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735308980204732467","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
